# calibreweb-requirements.in
# What CalibreWeb's venv is built from: CalibreWeb itself and the optional
# packages this library uses. Not pinned. update_calibreweb.sh propose resolves
# it to the newest versions allowed and writes calibreweb-requirements.txt,
# which is what an install actually uses.
#
# Optional packages beyond calibreweb's own dependencies:
#   comicapi   - metadata and covers for .cbz/.cbr comics (calibreweb extra "comics")
#   goodreads  - Goodreads author info (calibreweb extra "goodreads")
#   rarfile    - reading .cbr comics; needs an unrar binary set in CalibreWeb's
#                admin settings (calibreweb extra "metadata")
calibreweb
comicapi
goodreads
rarfile
